            "content": "<h6><strong>What is in one IMMUNE+++ tablet?</strong></h6><h6>While 1 IMMUNE+++ = the amount of Vitamin C in 8 oranges...​<br/><br/>IMMUNE+++ is <strong>MUCH MORE</strong> than another Vitamin C supplement.<br/>medicinal<br/></h6><h6>Each tablet contains extracts of powerful phytochemicals from fruits, functional mushrooms and herbs specifically known for immune-enhancing properties.​</h6><h6>The American Cancer Society recommends 6-7 servings of fruits and vegetables/day. <br/><br/>Of course, some are better than others. But it can be hard to make sure, every day, we get enough of these. </h6><h6>Taking a single tablet of IMMUNE+++ is similar to eating <strong>9-10 servings of nutrient-packed plants specifically beneficial for immune system support.</strong></h6><h6></h6>"
