            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<h5><strong>Life-C Vitamin C vs Other Blends of Vitamin C</strong></h5><h6>Life-C vitamin C found in IMMUNE+++ is very different than other types of vitamin C because it has lipid carriers which help it cross the lining of the gastrointestinal tract and increase its absorption. </h6><h6>This helps it get into the bloodstream faster where it circulates throughout the body.</h6><h6>Laboratory studies have shown the Life-C blend of vitamin C absorbs more easily into the body than other forms of vitamin C.</h6><h6>Life-C vitamin C can enter cells more efficiently where it’s needed most, making it more beneficial than other forms of vitamin C.</h6>",
            "link_url": "",
