    "faq_qK97ay": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_RJYHDM": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I take IMMUNE+++?",
            "content": "<p>The suggested daily usage for IMMUNE+++ is 1 to 2 tablets daily and is best taken right before a meal.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_QMJF46": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How many tablets are in each bottle of IMMUNE+++? ",
            "content": "<p>Each bottle of IMMUNE+++ contains 30 tablets.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_RA4UUW": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will taking IMMUNE+++ and LAMININE together boost its effects?",
            "content": "<p>Evidence indicates that taking IMMUNE+++ and LAMININE together for 12 weeks had a significant effect on important immune system components. <a href=\"https://www.lifepharm.com/media/pdf/ScienceArticles/I-ACN-Study.pdf?ref=retaildirect\">Read the entire study</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_fnUjdq": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are there any adverse reactions for IMMUNE+++?",
            "content": "<p>There are no documented cases of adverse reactions to IMMUNE+++. When taken as recommended, IMMUNE+++ is safe and effective. </p>"
          }
        },
        "item_97XWnU": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Am I getting too much Vitamin C from IMMUNE+++?",
            "content": "<p>The recommended daily value of Vitamin C varies from 85 mg to 2,000 mg per day, the upper range being well above the levels in IMMUNE+++. Additionally, because Vitamin C is water-soluble, the body will eliminate any Vitamin C it doesn’t use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_9LcdGr": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I take more over-the-counter forms of Vitamin C and receive the same benefit as I would from IMMUNE+++?",
            "content": "<p>IMMUNE+++ is a combination of the Opti-Shield Blend, Life-C Blend and an Herb and Botanical Blend, so it is not just another Vitamin C product. The Vitamin C that is in IMMUNE+++ is fueled by a unique delivery system that makes it more potent and effective than common Vitamin C products on the market today.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_Mejdmr": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "For how long do I need to take IMMUNE+++ before I notice results?",
            "content": "<p>The effects of IMMUNE+++ will vary by individual. Some may feel positive benefits in a short period of time and others may have to take the product longer to notice a change.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_a8eR8p": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "If I have a difficult time swallowing supplements, can I grind up IMMUNE+++ and put it in food or beverages?",
            "content": "<p>The recommended daily value of Vitamin C varies from 85 mg to 2,000 mg per day, the upper range being well above the levels in IMMUNE+++. Additionally, because Vitamin C is water-soluble, the body will eliminate any Vitamin C it doesn’t use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3YL7k4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "If I’m already not feeling well, can I take more IMMUNE+++?",
            "content": "<p>IMMUNE+++ is not intended to treat, cure or prevent any condition. It is a natural dietary supplement whose ingredients are well-known for boosting the body’s immune defense and response to illness-causing organisms. If you are feeling unwell, it’s best to speak with your physician.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
